  "description": "Faris Al Arab is a bold and refined masculine fragrance that blends fresh citrus, aromatic spices, and smooth woods into a modern Middle Eastern scent. The fragrance feels powerful, elegant, and versatile with a clean masculine structure balanced by warm depth. The opening introduces citrus notes and spicy accords, creating a bright and energetic first impression with an aromatic edge. The heart develops into lavender and woody notes, adding smooth masculine sophistication with subtle herbal freshness. The base settles into amber, musk, and sandalwood, leaving a warm, creamy, and long-lasting trail that feels polished and confident. Faris Al Arab is perfect for men who enjoy fresh woody fragrances with a spicy Middle Eastern touch and strong everyday versatility.",
